        "pitch": "Imagine San Francisco, but every position of power \u2013 every judge, every partner, every firm \u2013 is occupied by a sleek, sophisticated cat. Now, picture a relentlessly cheerful corgi, Barnaby, fresh out of law school and brimming with naive optimism, attempting to break into this feline stronghold. 'Paws & Precedent' is a heartwarming comedy about Barnaby\u2019s hilarious struggle to be taken seriously. He tries everything \u2013 mastering the art of the laser pointer negotiation tactic, tailoring his briefs with sardine-scented paper, even attempting to learn Cat Yoga. Visually, the film is a vibrant, stylized take on San Francisco\u2019s iconic locations, contrasting the corgi\u2019s goofy charm with the cats' cool composure. The soundtrack will blend quirky, upbeat jazz with mournful blues, echoing Barnaby\u2019s persistent hope versus the daunting reality of his situation.  It\u2019s 'Rocky' meets 'Ocean\u2019s Eleven', but with paws and whiskers, exploring themes of perseverance, prejudice, and finding your place in a world that doesn\u2019t seem built for you \u2013 all while delivering plenty of laugh-out-loud moments and a surprising amount of heartfelt connection.",
